  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "Profile Backup for DSH",
      "text": "> Config-only backup/restore for a DSH profile, without `node_modules`. Path-safe archive check and\n> force-backup semantics."
    },
    {
      "section": "Use",
      "text": "```bash\nnode bin/dsh-profile-backup.mjs backup --home ~/.dsh --profile web --out web-backup.tgz\nnode bin/dsh-profile-backup.mjs check --archive web-backup.tgz\nnode bin/dsh-profile-backup.mjs restore --archive web-backup.tgz --home ~/.dsh --profile web\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "Limits",
      "text": "- Config only; no sessions, secrets, or package cache\n- `--force` renames the existing profile to `.bak-*`; no automatic rollback\n- Does not boot-test the restored profile\n- Not a substitute for a full machine backup"
    },
    {
      "section": "Tests",
      "text": "```bash\nnpm test\n```"
    },
    {
